@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #fdfdfd
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af

title Page flow — facility (client-sessioned utterance)\nA person's free text builds the facility page; the navigator triages, scopes mining, reconciles against required_members, and responds

actor "Person / Client" as P
participant "Gate\n(facade)" as GATE
participant "UniversalNavigator\n(SharedServices)" as UN
database "sessions +\nrender ledger" as REPO
participant "UtteranceManager\n(classifier)" as UM
participant "UniversalNavigatorProxy\n(FindCare)" as PXY
participant "facility_search tool\n(FindCare)" as FS
participant "Prose tool" as PR

P -> GATE : free text\ne.g. "dialysis centers near Cleveland"
GATE -> UN : pass(session_token, head, params)
note right of GATE
  Dumb transport. Collects token, head
  and params; verifies nothing; owns
  no route; streams back.
end note

== triage: which of the five call types ==
UN -> REPO : load session by GUID
UN -> UN : proof = session_token present + signed\n-> call_type = client_sessioned\n(no api_key, no our_signature, not static)
note right of UN
  Only the navigator takes external
  traffic. It triages by the route's
  declared PROOF, then routes from
  the map.
end note

== determine page & scope mining ==
UN -> UN : read the map -> this request\nconstructs page = facility (NPI Type 2)
UN -> UM : classify\n(preamble + fragments scoped to facility members:\nfacility_search, facility_detail, prose)
note right of UM
  One model call, page-scoped on
  refinement. Returns the dispatch set
  only — knows no parameters. The
  assembled fragments ARE the classifier.
end note
UM --> UN : dispatch set -> {facility_search, prose}

== render ledger: record required_members ==
UN -> REPO : ledger: expect required_members = {facility_search}
note left of REPO
  Dispatch records the page's
  required_members as expectations;
  each completion callback closes one;
  the render_timeout budget races them.
end note

== dispatch (tool_to_tool, via proxy) ==
UN -> PXY : dispatch facility_search
PXY -> FS : relay locally (function call)
FS -> FS : match organizations only, active,\nby name / taxonomy / practice-location\ngeography / administrator (recursion-guarded)
FS --> PXY : facility list document
PXY --> UN : internal_callback (proof: our_signature)

== reconcile ==
UN -> REPO : ledger: close facility_search;\nmerge serially (shared lib) — a conflict RAISES
UN -> PR : author prose from the facts
PR --> UN : user-facing sentence
UN -> REPO : page reconciled\n(required_members closed within budget)

== respond ==
UN -> GATE : stream events (list + prose);\nfinal {ok, guid, session_token}
GATE -> P : rendered facility page

note over UN, REPO #f3f4f6
  Page error management (all instrumented with timings, severity to impact):
  • timeout — render budget wins the race -> UN responds anyway with the
    layman on_timeout explanation.
  • conflict — a parameter/state merge conflict -> raise (ChatHealthyException).
  • missing required — facility_search dies or never calls back -> raise.
  Every throw ends here in the UniversalNavigator; the proxy re-raises.
end note

@enduml
